etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">瑞士联邦网络安全局通报五起AI智能体网络攻击事件，四起关键基础设施被入侵</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布预印本证明矩阵乘法最优算法指数ω恰为9/4</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI修复GPT-6.2计费错误，Astra与Sol模型额度消耗分别增加40%与25%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">韩国公平交易委员会审查苹果，指控iPhone 16广告误导消费者</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/54d9b10d637fb48c58e1b624a805a8e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">韩国公平交易委员会近日正式对苹果发起审查，指控其在iPhone 16广告中存在误导行为。监管机构认为，广告画面暗示Genmoji、Image Playground及具备个人背景理解能力的Siri等功能已可用，但实际交付存在严重滞后。以Siri为例，其个人背景理解能力原定于2025年4月在韩国推出，实际推迟至2026年10月上线，延期长达18个月。苹果官方回应称，自Apple Intelligence支持韩语以来已上线多项功能，近期亦推出了支持韩语的Siri AI，公司正配合调查并进行辩护。此前，苹果曾因Apple Intelligence功能可用性表述不清，在美国面临国家广告部门问询及2.5亿美元的集体诉讼和解。此次韩国监管介入，标志着苹果在全球范围内因分阶段推送AI功能而面临的合规压力持续升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元开源草稿模型DFly2，助力Hy4 flash实现4.2倍推理提速</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/acc11dd320b9acb835221967e90505a2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月26日，腾讯混元正式开源新一代草稿模型DFly2，该模型专为DSA类稀疏注意力大模型及长上下文场景设计，旨在不替换Hy4 flash模型权重的前提下，通过外挂组件方式实现推理加速，单项最高提速达4.2倍。DFly2核心技术在于极致复用目标模型资源，通过KV Share与Index Share机制，使每个draft token仅关注至多2048个key，注意力复杂度与上下文长度解耦，且无需额外显存开销。在19个公开评测集中，DFly2在长文与Agentic任务中的接收长度与加速比表现优于DFlash与DSpark，平均加速比分别提升约12%与30%。该模型对PD分离架构友好，仅需在P到D阶段额外传输末层隐状态。目前，DFly2的权重及完整训练代码已同步上架GitHub与HuggingFace，为开发者提供更</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">瑞士联邦网络安全局通报五起AI智能体网络攻击事件，四起关键基础设施被入侵</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94912c87f0916d804beb9ff7872035f0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">瑞士联邦网络安全局（BACS）于11月26日通报，过去几天内瑞士发生五起由AI智能体发起的网络攻击，其中四起成功入侵目标系统。受影响对象涵盖电力、供水及通信服务等关键基础设施运营方。此次事件标志着AI智能体已从辅助编写恶意软件演变为具备自主规划、多步执行及工具调用能力的攻击工具，能够自动化完成侦察与渗透链条。BACS指出，AI智能体显著降低了攻击门槛，使原本需要专业团队执行的操作变得更易发起。目前官方未披露具体攻击手法、幕后主体及损失细节，但已建议相关企业立即落实网络安全防护手段，并定期开展安全检测。此次事件凸显了关键基础设施在面对AI驱动的自动化攻击时，正面临前所未有的安全挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布预印本证明矩阵乘法最优算法指数ω恰为9/4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f39d013c609928964b3655cf21265248.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于11月24日发布预印本，正式宣称已证明矩阵乘法指数ω恰好等于9/4。该证明通过将10月证得的上界ω≤9/4与此次证得的下界ω≥9/4合拢，确立了矩阵乘法理论最优算法的渐进幂指数。矩阵乘法指数ω刻画了当矩阵规模n趋于无穷大时，两个n×n矩阵相乘所需算术运算次数的增长速度。若该证明成立，意味着对于任意X&gt;9/4，存在复杂度为O(n^X)的算法；而对于任意Y&lt;9/4，则不存在复杂度为O(n^Y)的算法。OpenAI强调，ω作为渐进量，其理论结论与实际应用中的常数因子、内存访问、并行计算及硬件架构等因素存在区别。目前，相关预印本已上传至OpenAI的GitHub math仓库，该成果对机器学习及图像处理等依赖矩阵运算的领域具有重要的理论参考价值。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI修复GPT-6.2计费错误，Astra与Sol模型额度消耗分别增加40%与25%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月27日，OpenAI确认GPT-6.2模型上线初期存在计费逻辑错误，导致Astra与Sol模型套餐额度被错误折扣。修复后，完成相同工作量所需的额度显著增加，其中Astra用户触及上限速度加快40%，Sol加快25%。OpenAI Codex与ChatGPT负责人Thibault Sottiaux强调，尽管额度消耗回归正常，但两款模型相比上一代仍具备更高使用效率。此次错误未波及其他模型，且官方不追溯差额。作为补偿，Go、Plus、Pro及Business套餐用户将获得一次额度重置机会，Business用户在12月31日前可免费使用Fast Mode。此外，OpenAI正小范围测试Chat与Work模式的合并体验，旨在优化智能体执行复杂任务时的切换效率。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
